      "title": "SLIs, SLOs and SLAs: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "SLIs, SLOs and SLAs: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Three Terms",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "SLI",
                    "sub": "measured",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "SLO",
                    "sub": "internal target",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "SLA",
                    "sub": "contract, looser",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Term",
                "Is",
                "Example"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "**SLI**",
                  "good events ÷ valid events",
                  "successful requests ÷ total, per window"
                ],
                [
                  "**SLO**",
                  "target for an SLI over a window",
                  "99.9% succeed over 30 days"
                ],
                [
                  "**SLA**",
                  "contract with penalties",
                  "99.5% monthly, else credits"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Set the SLA ==looser== than the internal SLO",
                "Miss the SLO: internal alarm. Miss the SLA: {red:penalty}"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Pick SLIs Users Feel",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Users feel",
                "SLI"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Availability",
                  "successful requests ÷ total"
                ],
                [
                  "Latency",
                  "requests under threshold; ==p99==, not average"
                ],
                [
                  "Correctness",
                  "right answers ÷ total"
                ],
                [
                  "Freshness",
                  "data newer than a set age"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Average latency hides the slow tail"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Why Not 100%",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Cost rises steeply with each extra ==nine==",
                "Users cannot perceive reliability beyond their own network"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Target what users need, never 100%. The ==SLA== stays looser than the SLO."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Error Budgets and Burn Rate",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Error Budgets and Burn Rate",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Budget",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Error budget = ==1 − SLO==",
                "99.9% over 30 days: 43,200 min × 0.001 ≈ ==43 min== of downtime",
                "Spent by {red:incidents}, {orange:risky releases}, {blue:planned maintenance}",
                "Track remaining budget on a ==dashboard=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Burn Rate",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Burn rate = ==observed error rate ÷ allowed error rate==",
                "Allowed error rate for a 99.9% SLO is `0.001`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Burn rate",
                "Meaning (30-day window)"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "**1**",
                  "Budget lasts exactly the window"
                ],
                [
                  "**14.4**",
                  "{red:2%} of the budget gone in 1 hour"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Spending and Policy",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flowchart",
              "spec": {
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "q"
                  ],
                  [
                    "a",
                    "b"
                  ]
                ],
                "nodes": {
                  "q": {
                    "text": "Budget left?",
                    "shape": "diamond"
                  },
                  "a": {
                    "text": "Launches, experiments, chaos tests",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  "b": {
                    "text": "Freeze features, fix reliability",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                },
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "from": "q",
                    "to": "a",
                    "label": "yes"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "q",
                    "to": "b",
                    "label": "exhausted"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Unused budget is not a prize. ==Spend it deliberately==; when it hits zero, reliability work comes before features until it recovers."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Alerting on Symptoms, Not Causes",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Alerting on Symptoms, Not Causes",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Symptoms Page, Causes Don't",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Signal",
                "Goes to"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Error rate, latency, {red:SLO burn}",
                  "**Page**"
                ],
                [
                  "High CPU, full disk",
                  "Dashboard or ticket"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Page on what ==users feel==, not on guessed causes",
                "Cause metrics can be high with no user impact"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Multi-Window Burn Rate",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Action",
                "Burn rate",
                "Long window",
                "Confirm window"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "{red:Page}",
                  "14.4x",
                  "1h",
                  "5m"
                ],
                [
                  "{orange:Page}",
                  "6x",
                  "6h",
                  "30m"
                ],
                [
                  "Ticket",
                  "1x",
                  "3d",
                  "6h"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Alert fires only when ==both== windows are over the rate",
                "Short window ==resets fast== after the fix: no stale pages"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Keep Pages Honest",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A page must be ==urgent==, ==actionable== and need a **human**",
                "Otherwise delete it or downgrade it to a ticket",
                "Raw metric thresholds cause {red:alert fatigue}; alert on SLO consumption"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "promql",
              "lines": [
                "sum(rate(http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[1h]))",
                "  / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h])) > 14.4 * 0.001",
                "and",
                "sum(rate(http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
                "  / sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])) > 14.4 * 0.001"
              ],
              "note": "fast page for a 99.9% SLO: error ratio over 14.4 x 0.001"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
